    : "through systemd-cat at its absolute path; a container has no journal"; \
    : "socket, so that exec fails at line 70 with 'Failed to create stream fd'"; \
    : "and NOTHING below it ever runs. The first version of this guard was"; \
    : "therefore a check that could not fail -- it passed the broken script and"; \
    : "the fixed one identically. That variable is the script's own skip for the"; \
    : "re-exec, so setting it lets the top-level code actually execute."; \
    : ""; \
    : "-k 2 IS NOT OPTIONAL, and the first run of this guard proved it the"; \
    : "expensive way: the script traps TERM (its cleanup handler), and bash"; \
    : "delivers a trap only after the current foreground command returns --"; \
    : "which, once gamescope fails in a container with no DRM, is the hold"; \
    : "loop's sleep. timeout's polite TERM therefore waited on a sleep 3600"; \
    : "and the guard stalled the build for as long as nobody killed it. KILL"; \
    : "cannot be trapped, so -k 2 bounds the whole step at ~7 seconds."; \
